OL,3,GNEWSARuling to come on future of A5
OL,4,Aroad project
OL,5,
OL,6,FLast year a judge ruled against the
OL,7,Flong-delayed A5 road project going
OL,8,Fahead in its current form, upholding a
OL,9,Flegal challenge taken by a group of
OL,10,Flandowners
OL,12,FThe judge said the plans breached
OL,13,FNorthern Ireland climate change targets
OL,14,Fand criticised "an inadequacy of
OL,15,Finformation"
OL,17,FThe 58-mile (94km) #1.7bn project had
OL,18,Fbeen given a fresh green light by
OL,19,FStormont ministers in October 2024 but
OL,20,Fa group of landowners brought a legal
OL,21,Fchallenge in 2025
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,412,410,260,120,0,100
