OL,3,GNEWSARuling to come on future of A5
OL,4,Aroad project
OL,5,
OL,6,FToday we'll find out if the appeal,
OL,7,Ffrom Northern Ireland's Department for
OL,8,FInfrastructure (DfI), has been
OL,9,Fsuccessful with the judge due to
OL,10,Fdeliver a judgment
OL,12,FMore than 50 people have died on the A5
OL,13,Fsince 2006 and campaigners have long
OL,14,Fcalled for the road to be upgraded
